{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55232","headline":"翛公上人草书歌（题从《书苑菁华》） · 史松","name":"翛公上人草书歌（题从《书苑菁华》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真踪草圣今古有，翛公学得谁及否？\n古人今人一手书，师今书成在两手。\n书时须饮一斗酒，醉後扫成龙虎吼。\n风雨飘（《书苑菁华》作「惊」）兮魍魉走。\n千尺松枝如蠹朽，欲折不折横（《书苑菁华》作「挂」）岩口。\n张旭骨，怀素筋，筋骨一时传斯人，斯人传得（《书苑菁华》作「是」）[妙]通神。\n攘臂纵横草复真，一身疑是两人身。\n（同前，原缺一字。\n又见《书苑菁华》卷十七，作者署「史邕」，今据以校补。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"史松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}